  "prefLabel": "Plc 1905.07 Challenging a Denial of Certification Renewal; Challenging Certificate Conditions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1905.07 Challenging a Denial of Certification Renewal; Challenging Certificate Conditions. An applicant who wishes to challenge the denial of an application for certification renewal or who wishes to challenge conditions included in the certification shall do so in accordance with Plc 308.12.\n\nSource. #14429, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1900.html"
